{"4530600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ice Moon Odyssey", "steam_appid": 4530600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/cbb6f9d15f07f063b863bfc35af68cc8.avif?t=1776114441\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ice Moon Odyssey</i></strong> is a hand-painted 2d adventure game. You'll <i>explore</i>, <i>collect</i> <i>specimens</i>, and <i>craft upgrades</i> for your <i>research equipment</i>. <i>Stealth mechanics</i> and <i>'creature-care'</i> are important too. And you'll need to try not to get eaten by any <i>alien sea monsters</i> while you're out cruising the depths on your <strong><i>sea-bike</i></strong>..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a newly discovered moon of the planet Neptune. A small ice covered satellite which has been dubbed <strong><i>Glacialis</i></strong>. We thought it would be extra cool if life were discovered in the orbit of the mysterious blue gas giant. Afterall, Neptune was named after the roman god of the sea! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a <i>marine biologist</i> and <i>explorer</i>, known as an <strong><i>Icebreaker</i></strong>. Part scientist, part adventurer. And you have been tasked with documenting all that you find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/b776b77da0bd0c2a6d031b395eeb69e1.avif?t=1776114441\" width=680 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless you’ve been living in a pineapple under the sea (or under a rock, Patrick) then you know what’s going on with our environment. About the impacts we humans are having on things. But we're not here to point fingers. Most everyone on our team appreciates sushi as much as the next person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We know that you know</i> the ocean needs help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what it really seems to need most is <i>more geniuses, and big hearts, and heroes</i> to fight for it and to dream up new ways to heal it and protect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s where IMO comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see, there's a feeling we’ve been after. This whole time. A dream of hope. Wrapped up in cobalt-blue, cyan, cerulean, and ultramarine. Millions of hand-painted blue pixels, and music to swoon over, accompanied by the siren calls of never before seen wildlife hidden deep beneath the icy surface of a newly discovered alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/8c4638d63011a6f623055e1d02ec0d50.avif?t=1776114441\" width=680 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/cbb6f9d15f07f063b863bfc35af68cc8.avif?t=1776114441\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ice Moon Odyssey</i></strong> is a hand-painted 2d adventure game. You'll <i>explore</i>, <i>collect</i> <i>specimens</i>, and <i>craft upgrades</i> for your <i>research equipment</i>. <i>Stealth mechanics</i> and <i>'creature-care'</i> are important too. And you'll need to try not to get eaten by any <i>alien sea monsters</i> while you're out cruising the depths on your <strong><i>sea-bike</i></strong>..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place on a newly discovered moon of the planet Neptune. A small ice covered satellite which has been dubbed <strong><i>Glacialis</i></strong>. We thought it would be extra cool if life were discovered in the orbit of the mysterious blue gas giant. Afterall, Neptune was named after the roman god of the sea! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a <i>marine biologist</i> and <i>explorer</i>, known as an <strong><i>Icebreaker</i></strong>. Part scientist, part adventurer. And you have been tasked with documenting all that you find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/b776b77da0bd0c2a6d031b395eeb69e1.avif?t=1776114441\" width=680 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unless you’ve been living in a pineapple under the sea (or under a rock, Patrick) then you know what’s going on with our environment. About the impacts we humans are having on things. But we're not here to point fingers. Most everyone on our team appreciates sushi as much as the next person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We know that you know</i> the ocean needs help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what it really seems to need most is <i>more geniuses, and big hearts, and heroes</i> to fight for it and to dream up new ways to heal it and protect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s where IMO comes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see, there's a feeling we’ve been after. This whole time. A dream of hope. Wrapped up in cobalt-blue, cyan, cerulean, and ultramarine. Millions of hand-painted blue pixels, and music to swoon over, accompanied by the siren calls of never before seen wildlife hidden deep beneath the icy surface of a newly discovered alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/extras/8c4638d63011a6f623055e1d02ec0d50.avif?t=1776114441\" width=680 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Join the expedition! Explore the icy depths of Glacialis - a newly discovered moon of Neptune. Discover, collect, and survive.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/9c737b36029ab8fe9af5cdc16367983e0d54287a/header.jpg?t=1776114441", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/ef84c5c7fc34bb08b498a2caf1ce610f5ccc6808/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776114441", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530600/ef84c5c7fc34bb08b498a2caf1ce610f5ccc6808/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776114441", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10 / 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Game Quest Studios"], "publishers": ["Game Quest Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "